{
"id": 5762,
"en": "No Title",
"ctx": "menú/texto string_tbl"
},
{
"id": 5763,
"en": "Only birds that have reached perfection in every parameter are worthy of being called a legend.",
"ctx": "menú/texto string_tbl"
},
{
"id": 5764,
"en": "This title is reserved for birds with maximum Leg Power and Stamina. Their speed and endurance can't be beat.",
"ctx": "menú/texto string_tbl"
},
{
"id": 5765,
"en": "This title is reserved for birds with the highest level of suitability on dirt and in the dark.",
"ctx": "menú/texto string_tbl"
},
{
"id": 5766,
"en": "This title is reserved for birds with miraculous Leg Power that gives them the speed to leave opponents in the dust.",
"ctx": "menú/texto string_tbl"
},
{
"id": 5767,
"en": "This title is reserved for birds with nearly maximum Leg Power. There is little chance of them losing to most opponents.",
"ctx": "menú/texto string_tbl"
},
{
"id": 5768,
"en": "Only birds with pride in their Leg Power can earn this title. There is little chance of losing to average opponents.",
"ctx": "menú/texto string_tbl"
},
{
"id": 5769,
"en": "This title is reserved for birds with maximum Stamina. Such birds are like the horses of legend that could race a thousand miles in a day.",
"ctx": "menú/texto string_tbl"
},
{
"id": 5770,
"en": "This title is reserved for birds with nearly maximum Stamina. Their iron hearts can take all the verbal lashing you can give them.",
"ctx": "menú/texto string_tbl"
},
{
"id": 5771,
"en": "Only birds with pride in their Stamina earn this title. It is a testament to their tireless cardio-pulmonary function.",
"ctx": "menú/texto string_tbl"
},
{
"id": 5772,
"en": "This title is reserved for birds with the highest level of suitability on dirt. They can race on the most uneven surfaces utterly unimpeded.",
"ctx": "menú/texto string_tbl"
},
{
"id": 5773,
"en": "This title is reserved for birds with nearly maximum suitability on dirt. They can race on uneven surfaces with minor difficulty.",
"ctx": "menú/texto string_tbl"
},
{
"id": 5774,
"en": "Only birds with pride in their suitability on dirt earn this title. They need not fear losing their footing on dirt tracks.",
"ctx": "menú/texto string_tbl"
},
{
"id": 5775,
"en": "This title is reserved for birds with the highest level of suitability in the dark. They might as well be wearing night vision goggles!",
"ctx": "menú/texto string_tbl"
},
{
"id": 5776,
"en": "This title is reserved for birds with nearly maximum suitability in the dark. They charge bravely ahead in near-total darkness!",
"ctx": "menú/texto string_tbl"
},
{
"id": 5777,
"en": "Only birds with pride in their suitability in the dark earn this title. They can find their way in even the dimmest light.",
"ctx": "menú/texto string_tbl"
},
{
"id": 5778,
"en": "This title is reserved for birds that have mastered Intimidate and Threaten. Their fearsome cries have stopped many a bird in its tracks.",
"ctx": "menú/texto string_tbl"
},
{
"id": 5779,
"en": "This title is reserved for birds that have entered hundreds of races. These are tried and true racing birds in every sense.",
"ctx": "menú/texto string_tbl"
},
{
"id": 5780,
"en": "This title is reserved for birds that have won three races in a row.",
"ctx": "menú/texto string_tbl"
},
{
"id": 5781,
"en": "This title is reserved for birds that have won ten races in a row. These are exceptionally formidable birds, even among Cochin Cup Classic contenders.",
"ctx": "menú/texto string_tbl"
},
{
"id": 5782,
"en": "This title is reserved for birds who have won on every course and in every class. These heroes of the Cochin world have surmounted every obstacle in their quests for greatness.",
"ctx": "menú/texto string_tbl"
},
{
"id": 5783,
"en": "This title is given to lazy birds that stop more than three times in a race. They have a long and hard road ahead of them.",
"ctx": "menú/texto string_tbl"
},
{
"id": 5784,
"en": "This title is for birds nearing the end of their careers. Start thinking about a replacement.",
"ctx": "menú/texto string_tbl"
},
{
"id": 5785,
"en": "This title is for birds that have won countless times after being verbally lashed in races. Who knows what darkness lies behind their eyes?",
"ctx": "menú/texto string_tbl"
},
{
"id": 5786,
"en": "This title is for birds that have pulled off come-from-behind wins numerous times. Their never-say-die spirit is worthy of respect.",
"ctx": "menú/texto string_tbl"
}
]